  "prompt": "Giải các phương trình sau.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math></li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math></li></ol>",
